{"assets":[],"contestId":"29","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Problem A:"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"Check whether exist a pair i and j,they satisfy xi+di = xj && xj+dj = xi;"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"Problem B:"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"Pay attention to Just Right or Red. use Div and Mod can solve it easily;"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"Problem C:"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"As we know, there are only two path -- forward and reverse, so we can do DFS from the one-degree nodes (only two nodes)."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"As their index may be very larger, so I used map<int,int> to do hash."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"void dfs(int i)"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"{"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"     int sz = mat[i].size()-1, j;"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"     UF(j,0,sz)"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"     if (!vis[mat[i][j]])"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"     {"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"        vis[mat[i][j]] = 1;"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"        printf(\" %d\",val[mat[i][j]]);"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"        dfs(mat[i][j]);"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"     }"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"}"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"Problem D: "},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"Floyd."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"First, Floyd pretreat the path from I to J, and save the path. "},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"Then get the answer."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"The order is a1,a2...ak, K is the number of the leaves, we can assume a0 = a"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"k+1"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 1, the root."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"then, answer push_back the path[ai][a"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i+1"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":"]."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"if the ans.size() > 2*N-1 , cout -1;"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"else cout the answer."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"line_break"}],"kind":"document"},"schema":2,"sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/blog/entry/686"}